        "id": "i_sample_1",
        "origin": "authored-threat",
        "justification": "The design requires these controls; implementation and negative-test evidence remain to be reviewed. Active is not an observed exploit or risk acceptance.",
        "targetKind": "node",
        "targetId": "n_gateway",
        "scenarioIds": [
          "s_secure",
          "s_risky"
        ],
        "title": "Cross-document prompt injection",
        "description": "Reference review concern: Test ACL-filter construction, cross-tenant/chunk authorization and inert rendering; document text must never become a tool or system instruction.",
        "status": "Active",
        "createdAt": 1790969400000,
        "replies": []
      },
      {
        "id": "i_sample_2",
        "origin": "authored-threat",
        "justification": "Verify the named boundary-crossing controls before implementation approval. A declared requirement or clean deterministic result is not assurance.",
        "targetKind": "edge",
        "targetId": "e_generate",
        "scenarioIds": [
          "s_secure",
          "s_risky"
        ],
        "title": "Excessive provider disclosure",
        "description": "Reference review concern: Inspect the exact outbound grounding, provider geography/retention contract and no-tools configuration. A managed identity and clean Analyze result do not prove these properties.",
        "status": "Active",
        "createdAt": 1790969400000,
        "replies": []
      }
    ],
